   "date": "2026-10-03T13:53:30-05:00",
   "body": "There is no loot.\r\n\r\nCurrently getting this error at both locations while attempting to loot flowers. Some spawns appear to work. Others get the error. Between the amount of people trying to do this quest at the same time and the loot error, not a fun quest at the moment.\r\n\r\nLogging at both locations in an attempt to finish. Others are just camping. Welcome to beta.",
   "replies": []
  },
  {
   "rating": 2,
   "date": "2026-09-23T18:07:05-05:00",
   "body": "Look for purple flowers on both farms. The boars from there give animal blood as well.",
   "replies": []
  },
  {
   "rating": 1,
   "date": "2026-09-26T15:01:39-05:00",
   "body": "Part of a quest chain.\n\n[ol][li][quest=99127][/li]\n[li][quest=99128][/li]\n[li][quest=99129][/li]\n[li][quest=99130][/li]\n[li][quest=99131][/li][/ol]\n\nThe [url=https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=286214/duskweed-petal]flowers[/url] can be easy to miss. They sometimes spawn inside the bushes next to fences, but they're also somewhat abundant inside the fields. I recommend going to [b]Stonefield Farm[/b]. Kill some boars for [item=286215] in between flower spawns. I found the blood to have a lower drop rate compared to other quests in the zone, at around 25%.",
   "replies": []
  }
 ]
